WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.300
Step 3 reads the findings.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.813
The gateway's policy is in detection.

3
00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:09.325
The careers Front Door profile
has no WAF and sends no logs.

4
00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:12.802
Both policies are a rule-set
version behind the baseline,

5
00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:15.687
and the Front Door policy
has no bot protection.

6
00:00:15.687 --> 00:00:20.113
The intranet gateway has a private
frontend only, so it isn't counted.

7
00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:23.048
Step 4 reads the plan the
kit wrote and didn't run:

8
00:00:23.048 --> 00:00:25.984
Learn's switch command
for the gateway's policy,

9
00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:30.650
with its resource group and subscription,
ready for the application owner.

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.170
Step 5 runs the chapter's tests.
